WEBVTT

00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:30.785
during that assessment,

00:05:30.785 --> 00:05:35.373
she find out that she has a pathway
to receive the remainder of those credits

00:05:35.414 --> 00:05:36.624
for her degree

00:05:36.665 --> 00:05:39.168
in less than five months.

00:05:40.628 --> 00:05:42.421
A few of us are doing this.

00:05:43.297 --> 00:05:45.091
But here's what I hope for.

00:05:45.508 --> 00:05:49.720
My hope is that time

00:05:49.762 --> 00:05:53.224
becomes even more variable.

00:05:54.517 --> 00:05:57.228
So let's build a global skills bank,

00:05:57.269 --> 00:05:59.188
much like a financial bank.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.773
But in this case,